Warning [jet.UnusedLocalBinding]: Local binding `text_secret` is never read.
  --> imported_secret_type_keeps_its_static_conversion_apis.jet:8:5
    |
  8 |     text_secret :: Secret.from_text("mail credential")
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A binding that no later expression reads adds dead code and may hide a computed result that should have been used.
 Fix: Remove the binding when its initializer is side-effect free, or rename `text_secret` to `_text_secret` when the value must be computed.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0101

